{
  "about": "Decision 145b: the model a start may name, per agent. The server (apps/server/src/agent/model.rs) refuses anything not accepted here with model_unavailable before a start goes out; the host (apps/runtime/src/profile.rs, model_args) refuses it again and turns an accepted one into exactly `args`, the agent's own launch flag. Neither crate depends on the other: this file keeps them on one rule. Every accepted value is ASCII letters, digits and . _ : / - only, starts with a letter or digit, and is bounded, so it can reach argv (and a Windows .cmd shim) unescaped.",
